#: levels/l1_substation.gd:1408
msgid "Printout: Load-Shed Order 0417"
msgstr ""

#: levels/l1_substation.gd:1409
msgid ""
"[b]LAKESHORE ELECTRIC COOPERATIVE - SYSTEM OPERATIONS[/b]\n"
"[b]EMERGENCY LOAD-SHED ORDER 0417[/b]\n"
"Dec 18, 2026 02:11\n"
"Issued by Regional Dispatch\n"
"\n"
"Grid emergency, Level 3 (polar vortex). Effective immediately the following feeders are to be opened and held open:\n"
"\n"
"   KF-1  Main Street / Downtown\n"
"   KF-2  School / Church / Residential\n"
"\n"
"Feeder KF-1 and KF-2 shed per Corvane Systems Priority Load Agreement, section 4.2.\n"
"\n"
"[b]MERIDIAN load protected.[/b]\n"
"Feeder KF-3 (Lake Road) is to remain closed.\n"
"\n"
"Do not restore any shed feeder without written release from Dispatch. Estimated duration: indeterminate.\n"
"\n"
"Acknowledge receipt.\n"
"- K. Hallstrom, Dispatch\n"
"\n"
"Handwritten underneath, in blue pen:\n"
"\"There will not be a release. - R.\""
msgstr ""

#: levels/l1_substation.gd:1410
msgid "Operator's switching order and log"
msgstr ""

#: levels/l1_substation.gd:1411
msgid ""
"[b]SWITCHING ORDER - RESTORE KF-2[/b]\n"
"(copy from the manual, for my own sake)\n"
"\n"
"1. Verify BKR-KF2 OPEN.\n"
"2. CLOSE DS-2A (bus side).\n"
"3. CLOSE DS-2B (line side).\n"
"4. CLOSE BKR-KF2. Last.\n"
"\n"
"[b]NEVER[/b] operate a disconnect with the breaker closed. A disconnect cannot interrupt load. It arcs, and it takes you with it.\n"
"[b]DS-2C is the bypass.[/b] Maintenance only. Leave it alone.\n"
"\n"
"Hot stick is on the hook in my truck bed. The breaker's control fuse (60A) blew in November. The spare is in the cabinet in the stores container. Padlock froze. Pry it.\n"
"\n"
"[b]LOG[/b]\n"
"12/19  Temp -34. Heater only. Dispatch: hold.\n"
"12/20  Temp -39. Heard from Deb. Not good.\n"
