#: levels/l2_school.gd:1801
msgid ""
"[b]KETTLE FALLS WARMING SHELTER — LOG[/b]\n"
"KFCS Gym · R. Kade, coordinator\n"
"\n"
"[b]DEC 18[/b]  Grid down 6:10 pm. Co-op says \"load management.\" Opened the gym at 7. 41 signed in. Cots from the Legion, blankets from St. Brendan's.\n"
"\n"
"[b]DEC 19[/b]  Boiler tripped overnight. Walt says it's the 60-amp control fuse; the spare is in the shop-class drawer. Shop is locked. Walt's janitor keys hang on a hook in the yard shed, because of course they do. Locker rooms flooded when a line burst, now one big ice rink. Walt dropped the feed-valve wheel in there shutting off the water. It's frozen in the pipe. He says you'd need a hatchet. 63 in.\n"
"\n"
"[b]DEC 20[/b]  Three didn't wake this morning. Cold doesn't look like that. Frost on the INSIDE of their eyes. Moved them to the stage and covered them. Dr. Aho says don't touch.\n"
"Rule one: DO NOT SLEEP OUTSIDE THE GYM. Rule two: nobody sleeps alone.\n"
"\n"
"[b]DEC 21, 2 am[/b]  Checked off: Aho ✓ Bergstrom ✓ Lindqvist ✓ Moe ✓ Paulsen ✗ ✗ ✗ ✗\n"
"I stopped checking.\n"
"\n"
"Tom's voice in the vents tonight. I know it can't be. He said my name the way he did coming up the stairs.\n"
"I'm going to the front doors to listen."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l2_school.gd:1803
msgid "Drawing: \"the man with the light on his head\""
msgstr ""

#: levels/l2_school.gd:1804
msgid ""
"[b]Crayon on construction paper.[/b]\n"
"\n"
"A tall black stick figure with a yellow scribble on its head and lines coming out of it. Four little stick people in a row beneath it, Xs for eyes.\n"
"\n"
"In pencil, shaky, a child's capitals:\n"
"[i]THE MAN WITH THE LIGHT ON HIS HEAD. HE WALKS AROUND OUTSIDE AT NIGHT. HE KNOCKS ON THE WINDOW AND SAYS OUR NAMES. MOM SAYS ITS JUST THE WIND. MR PELTO SAID DONT LOOK AT THE LIGHT.[/i]\n"
"\n"
"— Hannah W., grade 2"
