msgid ""
"[b]Voice memo — I. Hart[/b]\n"
"\n"
"If you are reading this, they got in. The seal on the cold aisle went and I couldn't move the cabinets fast enough.\n"
"\n"
"The card is on the desk. It opens the pipeline service tunnel. Go down. The colony is on the pipe walls. If anyone gets a sample, label it HART / BP-7 and make them read the whole report.\n"
