#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:947
msgid "Stop there. Hands where I can see them. ...Breath fog. A pulse, I'd guess. Good enough."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:948
msgid "Elias Kade, Lakeshore Electric. I'm looking for my daughter. Fifteen, parka, knit hat. June."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:949
msgid "Kade. ...A woman in her sixties and a girl in a hat came through the loading dock eleven hours ago."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:950
msgid "MERIDIAN let them in. It doesn't count people who aren't in the badge database."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:951
msgid "Where did they go?"
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:952
msgid "Down the pipeline service tunnel. Into Lower Kettle. It's the only warm road in this town. The Rime follows warm."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:953
msgid "The Rime."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:954
msgid "Imogen Hart, Northline geology. Eight months ago I cored a brine pocket and found something alive in it. Ten thousand years dormant."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:955
msgid "I filed the report. Northline and Corvane buried it under three NDAs and a bonus. Then they piped this building's waste heat down that shaft."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:956
msgid "Forty megawatts of warmth, delivered to a thing that eats heat. It woke. It's growing up the pipe toward everything warm."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:957
msgid "Three nights ago the grid dropped the whole town to keep this place running."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:958
msgid "Section 4.2. Priority load. The town was cheaper to turn off."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:963
msgid "Your pockets are full. Drop something. I'm not carrying this for you."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:966
msgid "Take this. Pipeline override card. It opens the service tunnel at the pipeline head."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:971
msgid "One thing. The colony coats the pipe walls. Scrape me a sample. A glove, a vial, anything. Proof."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:972
msgid "I'm going down for my family, doctor. Not for evidence."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:973
msgid "Then bring it by accident. And be careful with MERIDIAN. It never lies. It just never cares."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:975
msgid "Take the pipeline service tunnel (pipeline head, east of the NOC) down to the mine."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:977
msgid "Go. The warm air is a lie. Every degree it gives you, it takes back from them."
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:1000
msgid "BREAK ROOM"
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian.gd:1001
msgid "Whoever last used the microwave: 99.9997% of us hate you."
