#: levels/l4_meridian_text.gd:16
msgid "Project Warmth: PR one-pager"
msgstr ""

#: levels/l4_meridian_text.gd:17
msgid ""
"[b]PROJECT WARMTH[/b]\n"
"[i]Northline Mineral + Corvane Systems. A greener Kettle Falls.[/i]\n"
"\n"
"Every data centre makes heat. Most throw it away. MERIDIAN sends 40 MW of waste heat 2.4 km through the HR-1 pipeline to Lower Kettle Mine, thawing the brine, lifting lithium yield 18%, and cutting the mine's carbon footprint to zero.\n"
"\n"
"[i]'Heat that used to vanish into the lake is going to work for this community.' — Corvane VP Communications[/i]\n"
"\n"
"• 140 construction jobs\n"
"• A 'Community Warmth Dividend' for every Kettle Falls household\n"
"• 100% recycled energy\n"
"\n"
"[b]FAQ[/b]\n"
"Q: Is it safe?\n"
"A: Absolutely.\n"
"Q: What is the ice in the return line?\n"
"A: [i][ANSWER PENDING — LEGAL][/i]\n"
"Q: Who gets the heat when the grid is short?\n"
"A: [i][DO NOT ANSWER][/i]"
msgstr ""

